                              <p>Dr. Deepmala Mahla, an accomplished leader in the humanitarian and development sector, currently serves as the Chief Humanitarian Officer for CARE. With an illustrious career spanning over 25 years, Dr. Mahla has consistently demonstrated her commitment to driving positive change and managing complex challenges.

